{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c369236be1af07d28e847ee252657c5321b4ec37bdfc39f2001f8fb0916c776",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0af5d4cb2232e171463f132edfa25e5aea865fe2d6dbf2acf9c2147fe900fc7",
      "text": "话……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d7e09b3f60f203858cebc8fbaf3815fbc4e3504182c834096117c876228006",
      "text": "如今，这个国家正处于前所未有的混乱之中。\n因此，哪怕只让皮埃尔大人一人逃脱出去也好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c521f9d98faacf44c99eaa81d6a58ebd19c5f42ea9da2071e862425201e1d162",
      "text": "意思是……流亡吗？\n可是，到底要去哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26cede1028d739f5d730ee749b0c1d942938eddda030be052b2c5ddfbf5a3fed",
      "text": "便是王妃殿下从前留学过的东方岛国。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:904ca1de722dd101d4e0bf41bd05ab37d70d998072498625113a2d62407be2a5",
      "text": "是日本对吧？\n以前听母后提起过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c2b559d0888aca9e65f165f8d6ce2ac687cc81efabc638d37022bd40e2f940",
      "text": "难道说，这件事也是母后拜托你的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31133fc7b45f369f76b4c0e21a63554b8f9bab079ec02c891f8c1596e0d62ef",
      "text": "是的。不过，王妃殿下会留下来。\n去往日本的，只有皮埃尔大人和几名保镖……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1397f1595fcec9c49eb6610d087e88009b584ca209456e98a66f0414bb091ccc",
      "text": "（……我明白。\n母后是王妃，不能轻易离开国家）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63df2a759be0fe92ac841e965ef722610c321e5b17258192b66681816859ee54",
      "text": "（即便只是个小小的国家，我们也是\n王室的一员……肩负着整个国家）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d88bb1bfe551b4191d6275f5662fc110e73c1293b72f71c7c4c090e26013fd8",
      "text": "（既然这样，我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
